{
  "id": "playmore.sfx.chip",
  "name": "Chip",
  "description": "A betting chip dropped on the pile: a bright clink of two inharmonic sine partials, `$clink` and `$chime`, struck hard and gone in a tenth of a second, over a click of highpassed noise for the contact. Fires in runs when several chips go down, so it rolls its pitch a little per trigger.",
